From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mt <mt@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:05:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] a2dp: LDAC, aptX, UAT, UAT-TWS and AAC endpoints, compatible
 with HiBy's bluetoothd

Re-implements the codec layer of the stock HiBy R3 Pro bluetoothd (BlueZ 4.101 + vendor
endpoints) from the protocol: extended endpoint registration with vendor and codec ids,
capability and configuration handlers per codec, in-place reconfigure routing for a codec
change, START handling without the 5 s automatic suspend, and the link MTU in the
configuration response.
